# Odysseus fork (odysseus-echo): key layout for the Echo Show 5 (2nd gen) privacy button.
#
# On LineageOS 18.1 (cronos) the microphone/camera privacy button is two input devices:
#   gpio-privacy-state   SW_MUTE_DEVICE  -> Android mutes the microphone (wanted)
#   gpio-privacy-button  KEY_POWER (116) -> Android goes to sleep (not wanted)
# This file is installed as /data/system/devices/keylayout/gpio-privacy-button.kl (not /system;
# InputReader checks /data/system/devices after /odm, /vendor and /system, which have no file for
# this device, before falling back to Generic.kl). It maps no keys, so the button's power key is
# ignored and only the mute switch takes effect. Loaded at boot. Undo: delete the file, reboot.
